# uv auto-generated lockfile + zoder review scratch files. The lockfile
# is not part of the published distribution; it's regenerated on demand
# by `uv lock` (and only used locally to keep `uv run` happy when the
# sibling mnemos-core checkout is at ../mnemos-core). zoder_run.log is
# the review harness's append-only scratch log and contains no project
# data — committing it would only add noise to future diffs.
uv.lock
zoder_run.log
.zoder_task_*.md
# One-off task description file dropped by the harness on each task;
# not a project artifact.
TASK_P2_GRAEAE.md
